"en": "Allah gives Dhul-Qarnayn authority and the means to reach his goals. He travels to where the sun sets — seeing it set, as it appears, into dark water — and finds a people. Given the choice to punish or treat them well, he says wrongdoers will be punished and then face their Lord, while those who believe and do good will have the best reward and be given easy instructions. He then travels to where the sun rises, over a people with no shelter from it.",
