"So he went back down, filled his leather sock with water, held it in his teeth, and climbed up. Then he gave the dog water to drink.",
"Allah thanked him for it, and forgave him.",
"The Companions asked: O Messenger of Allah, is there really a reward for us in caring for animals? He answered that there is a reward for kindness to every living being."
